WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.125
Some say I’m the best in the world…

00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:08.583
I agree with them.

00:00:08.583 --> 00:00:09.708
I’m Lionel Messi.

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:11.500
I let my football speak for itself…

00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:14.625
I should have played for the Spanish team.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.458
Say your name!

00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:17.833
Kevin.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.625
People said I couldn’t carry Egypt...

00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:22.125
They were right.

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:23.833
People say I lack focus

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:25.125
I say

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:26.458
focus on THIS

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.208
Rules are meant to be broken

00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:30.875
so is Mo Salah

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.875
I’m not here to make friends

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:34.750
I’m here to make history

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.875
I’m not here to make friends either

00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:38.250
but if I did make a friend

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.875
that’d be nice because I’m a bit lonely at Real

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:43.500
At first I thought it was a language barrier thing

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.125
but now I speak some Spanish

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:46.041
and still–

00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:46.916
Man U?

00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:49.416
More like Man Me

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:51.041
I don’t dress to impress

00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:52.666
I dress to gegenpress

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.250
Can you tell us some more about yourself Kevin?

00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:57.541
De Bruyne

00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:02.291
Remember that amazing goal I scored to win the Puskas?

00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:03.958
Neither do I

00:01:03.958 --> 00:01:06.625
I'm Paul and I know how to make headlines

00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:11.833
Yo la eh metido mas en Manchester que Noel Gallagher

00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:13.125
I'm so good

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:16.375
I'm in the MLS, and they still put me in this intro

00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:19.875
Everybody knows I’m at the same level as Messi and Ronaldo…

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:22.583
...why is everybody laughing?

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.458
Football is in my veins

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:26.583
Also growth hormones

00:01:26.583 --> 00:01:27.958
Forget John Terry

00:01:27.958 --> 00:01:30.083
I’m the real “Mr. Steal Your Girl”

00:01:30.083 --> 00:01:32.708
[unintelligible]

00:01:32.708 --> 00:01:33.875
Could we do that one more time, Harry?

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:34.958
I didn’t quite catch that

00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:36.708
[unintelligible]

00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:38.333
Alright, can we just get an actor in here?

00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:39.583
Board up your windows

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:41.375
it’s Harry Kane season

00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:42.958
Bayern is not sleeping

00:01:42.958 --> 00:01:45.958
we’re just giving other teams in Bundesliga a head start

00:01:45.958 --> 00:01:47.083
I dress in all black

00:01:47.083 --> 00:01:49.500
because every game is a funeral for the other team

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.833
Right now this show is good

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:51.625
people are happy

00:01:51.625 --> 00:01:52.958
But wait until Season 3

00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:54.250
things will go very bad

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:55.208
I’m Fellaini

00:01:55.208 --> 00:01:57.500
and in this show, I will NEVER cut my hair

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.458
Sorry—sorry I’m late

00:02:00.458 --> 00:02:01.958
Uh, hello! I’m—

00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:05.083
I am very happy for Luka that he won the Ballon d’Or

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:08.208
But mainly that Ronaldo didn’t win! Hahah!

00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:10.875
I’m Phil Jones and nobody wants to face me

00:02:10.875 --> 00:02:13.333
AND NOBODY WANTS ME FACE!

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:14.125
Robben, can you check your feet?

00:02:14.125 --> 00:02:15.083
Make sure you’re on your mark

00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:16.458
Oh, sure, yeah

00:02:16.458 --> 00:02:17.708
Wait, I have two of these?!

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.666
I kick shins and knees like they’re balls.

00:02:21.666 --> 00:02:23.791
I also kick balls like they’re balls.

00:02:23.791 --> 00:02:25.125
I am so pumped to join Chelsea,

00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:26.375
because I was in danger

00:02:26.375 --> 00:02:27.750
of actually winning things at Dortmund,

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.208
and that would go against everything

00:02:29.208 --> 00:02:31.083
the U.S. men's national team believes in.

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:32.958
Every time we get a bad result,

00:02:32.958 --> 00:02:34.750
I take a hard look in the mirror...

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.791
and I blame the officials, the wind,

00:02:36.791 --> 00:02:39.166
the cut of the grass, the smells of the stadium, the

00:02:39.166 --> 00:02:40.166
I’m back, and winning

00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:40.791
I’m back, and winning

00:02:40.791 --> 00:02:42.875
is in my jeans.

00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:45.541
If you need a cross into the box,

00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:47.875
pray you have an Angel on your wing.

00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:49.916
Money can't buy you silverware...

00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:52.250
is what the chairman keeps telling me.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.500
Don't hate me because I'm beautiful.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.750
Hate me because I had a great World Cup

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:57.625
five years ago

00:02:57.625 --> 00:02:58.958
and not much else.

00:02:58.958 --> 00:03:00.500
I'm not the new Ronaldo.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.375
I'm the first Vinicius.

00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:04.458
Oh, except for Vinicius Sr.

00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:06.333
Despite recent results,

00:03:06.333 --> 00:03:09.333
we already got the historic quadruple this season.

00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:10.541
We were investigated by

00:03:10.541 --> 00:03:13.375
UEFA, FIFA, the FA and the Premier League!

00:03:13.375 --> 00:03:16.083
I followed in the footsteps of the greats...

00:03:16.083 --> 00:03:17.333
by leaving Southampton!

00:03:17.333 --> 00:03:18.958
You think Icardi's a dog?

00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:20.500
I shagged me brother's missus.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.958
-Alright, and that's all we need.

00:03:21.958 --> 00:03:23.375
Thank you for coming in, Mr. Giggs.

00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:26.250
I'm one of the best players in the world...

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:27.666
according to my paycheck.

00:03:27.666 --> 00:03:30.041
People say I would be good in the Premier League,

00:03:30.041 --> 00:03:32.375
but first I need to be good in Serie A.

00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:35.416
Thanks, Kepa, but, ugh, we actually need a Champions League goalkeeper.

00:03:35.416 --> 00:03:37.500
So, ugh, if you could just, ugh, go ahead and get off the set.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.250
It was just a cramp. I'm staying. You can't make me go!

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.875
Zizou's back! Isco be alright.

00:03:47.875 --> 00:03:49.666
And for my next trick,

00:03:49.666 --> 00:03:52.791
I will make myself reappear as a relevant player!

00:03:52.791 --> 00:03:54.666
Now that the transfer window is over,

00:03:54.666 --> 00:03:56.541
I could spend more time pursuing my hobbies.

00:03:56.541 --> 00:03:57.958
Ya know, like playing football!

00:03:57.958 --> 00:03:59.916
Hi, this is me, Christian Eriksen!

00:03:59.916 --> 00:04:03.458
I love to play football for Tottenham Hotspur, I'm so happy!

00:04:03.458 --> 00:04:05.375
Ah, no. Hello.

00:04:05.375 --> 00:04:06.708
Watch out Champions League,

00:04:06.708 --> 00:04:09.000
it's time for Atlanta to rock your world.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.708
Uh, it's Atalanta.

00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:11.583
Ah, s--t.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:15.041
I am so sick of all the vanity and the egos in Paris.

00:04:15.041 --> 00:04:17.291
That is why next season, I'm going to Miami.

00:04:17.291 --> 00:04:21.041
If you come at Napoli, be prepared to get a pizza me...

00:04:21.041 --> 00:04:24.416
Ever since I was a young boy, I dreamed of playing for Juv...

00:04:24.416 --> 00:04:25.708
Piemonte Calcio

00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:29.333
And just remember, don't overlook Olympiacos!

00:04:29.333 --> 00:04:32.708
This Halloween, I dressed up as a real, Premier League man.

00:04:32.708 --> 00:04:33.750
Hat-trick-or-treat!

00:04:34.083 --> 00:04:37.833
Ever since coming to Barcelona, it’s been difficult to connect with Messi.

00:04:37.833 --> 00:04:37.875
He's never online!

00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:39.500
He's never online!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.458
OK. Just hold on for one second. I want to send this.

00:04:42.458 --> 00:04:43.833
It's going to be so funny.

00:04:44.291 --> 00:04:46.333
What, what? Oh, no. Oh, no.

00:04:46.333 --> 00:04:47.541
Delete, delete, delete, delete!

